<p>In case you come back to see this reply:</p>
<p>You are most certainly correct. As for what this basic plot will do:</p>
<ul>
<li>Introduce Gabriel (A character I may have for future tales)</li>
<li>GOI Building: I want to build on how the GOI operates (CI). At least, how they carry out their missions. So far, we have an idea how they work, but I've only seen a handful of tales in action.</li>
<li>The SCP will either be A. selected from a pre-existing SCP or B. Be an SCP I was hoping to work on. I would prefer A, but we'll see how that works.</li>
<li>Most Importantly: I want to show the inner workings of the Logistics Department. Routes, assignments, so on and so forth. The Action/Horror is just a way to get invested in the boring delivery job. Also showing that while it's usually boring, there is still risk in being in this sort of job. Any Foundation job is dangerous. I just want to show WHY this one is dangerous.</li>
</ul>

